# `analytics.get_session`

Analytics detail for one session.

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.analytics.read`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `session_key` | `string` |

## Returns

`AnalyticsSessionResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `session` | `map` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call analytics.get_session --json '{ "session_key": "" }'
```

Kind: read.

## Example response

```json
{
  "session": {
    "session_key": "sess-rust-lane-1",
    "actor_id": "actor-rust-lane-harbor",
    "harness": "claude",
    "model": "claude-opus-4-7",
    "started_at": "2026-05-24T18:00:00Z",
    "ended_at": "2026-05-24T18:30:00Z",
    "duration_ms": 1800000,
    "tool_use_count": 42,
    "tool_error_count": 1,
    "reason": "completed"
  }
}
```
